// Tai Bwo Wannai Trio - the original quest (ported from PlagueCityRS 349), original stage numbers.
//
// %tbwt_main            the quest stage, 0-6 below. The six multinpc shells in the 377 cache key
//                       on it: each son is out in the field (shore / Cairn Isle / jungle) at 0-5 and
//                       at home in the village at 6, which is exactly ^tbwt_complete, so the cache
//                       and the original stage numbers agree.
// %tbwt_tiadeche, %tbwt_tinsay, %tbwt_tamayu, %tbwt_lubufu   one progress varp per strand.
// %tbwt_flags           a bitfield: Timfraku's title for you (bits 0-1), whether Tiadeche has handed
//                       you his first catch (bit 2), how many doses of agility potion Tamayu has
//                       drunk (bits 3-5) and which spears he has been given (bits 6-8).
//
// Save migration from this server's earlier invented version: port349_migrate_tbwt.rs2.

